[
  {
    "title": "Redundancy & Fault Tolerance",
    "tag": "LESSON 25",
    "code": "Chapter 5 · Computer systems and networks",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Redundancy<br>&amp; Fault Tolerance</h1><p class=\"zh\">冗余 · 故障 · 可达性</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Explain what continues working after failure</p>",
    "note": "容错不是从不出故障，而是指定部件失效后仍能维持某项功能。本课持续说清失效对象、保留功能和证据。",
    "kind": "dark",
    "time": "0–2 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve routing and delivery limits",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "code": "CSN-1.B/C",
    "html": "<p>A–C fails on route S–A–C–T. If A–D and D–T work, give another route.</p><p>Does that route guarantee every packet arrives?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–D–T is an alternative. No; a path is not a packet-delivery guarantee.</div></details>",
    "note": "提取L24的替代路径与IP服务边界。解释容错时既不悲观说一边断全网断，也不夸大成万无一失。",
    "time": "2–6 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A fault-tolerance claim needs a scope",
    "tag": "TARGETS",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<ul><li>Which component fails?</li><li>Which function must continue?</li><li>What evidence shows a working alternative?</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Evidence: a failure table, valid paths and one design tradeoff.</p>",
    "note": "目标功能限定S到T可达，不能把一次成功扩大为整个应用一直可用。活动仅关闭边，不模拟设备故障、供电或真实丢包率。",
    "time": "6–8 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Redundancy provides usable alternatives",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.2/3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">The model contains more than one S-to-T path.</p><p class=\"visual-note\">Extra links help only when they support a useful alternative after a failure.</p>",
    "note": "冗余为额外部件用于减轻其他部件故障影响。给出S-A-C-T和S-B-D-T；两条链路不共享中间节点，是这个图中明显的替代例，但仍共用S、T端点。",
    "time": "8–12 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Fault tolerance means a function continues",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A stated communication function can continue after a component failure when another route remains.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A stated communication function can continue after a component failure when another route remains.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Before</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S reaches T</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Failure</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one link unavailable</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">After</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S still reaches T</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">via an alternative</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Name the tolerated failure; do not claim immunity to every failure.</p>",
    "note": "定义以仍能执行功能为核心。强调can support failures不是任何故障组合都支持。用具体断A-C、仍有S-A-D-T作基本证明。",
    "time": "12–16 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A failed link need not disconnect the endpoints",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M521.0 51.0L539.0 69.0M521.0 69.0L539.0 51.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A–C is unavailable. S–A–D–T still uses working links.</p>",
    "note": "此页workedexample可高亮答案路线。关闭边用虚线与叉，线在图上仍可见供比较但已不可用。学生跟读每一条高亮边确认未走关闭边。",
    "time": "16–20 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Some failure combinations remove every route",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 106.0L234.0 124.0M216.0 124.0L234.0 106.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 216.0L234.0 234.0M216.0 234.0L234.0 216.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Both links out of S are unavailable. Extra links elsewhere cannot reconnect S.</p>",
    "note": "S只邻接A和B，二者都断后S孤立；无论远处C-D多余连接如何，S无第一跳。这说明局部瓶颈及成组失效，别只数图仍剩六边。",
    "time": "20–24 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Two logical paths can share a physical risk",
    "tag": "LIMITATION",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.5/6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Logically distinct paths may share a physical failure risk such as one cable tunnel.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Logically distinct paths may share a physical failure risk such as one cable tunnel.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Path 1</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">cable in tunnel X</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Path 2</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">cable in tunnel X</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared failure</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">tunnel damage</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">affects both</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">The six-node lab does not model shared power or physical locations.</p>",
    "note": "拓展帮助理解“多路”不自动故障独立。隧道为虚构例，真实冗余设计应核查供电、机房与线路共享；不进入攻击或安全威胁内容。",
    "time": "24–28 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "An alternative route may have a different cost",
    "tag": "TRADEOFF",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.6 · model extension",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Alternative paths can use different numbers of links, while real delay also depends on link conditions.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Alternative paths can use different numbers of links, while real delay also depends on link conditions.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Route A</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">3 hops</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Route B</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">4 hops</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Comparison</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">time needs more</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">than hop count</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">For an equal-1-unit-per-hop model only, these costs are 3 and 4 units.</p>",
    "note": "说明跳数不等于真实延迟。为课堂比较可额外声明每跳1单位且忽略其他因素，此时4比3长1；不能把图的线条长度当实际毫秒。",
    "time": "28–32 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Redundancy uses resources",
    "tag": "TRADEOFF",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.6/7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Redundancy can improve resilience while requiring additional components and maintenance.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Redundancy can improve resilience while requiring additional components and maintenance.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Add alternatives</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">links + equipment</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Potential benefit</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">more failures</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">can be tolerated</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">installation +</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">maintenance</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A design decision weighs the function protected against its resource cost.</p>",
    "note": "不以“更多一定最好”结束。冗余增加成本和管理，某条新边只改善部分故障，对孤立端点未必有帮助。题目没有金额则不编数值成本。",
    "time": "32–36 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A working route is one part of an end-to-end service",
    "tag": "SYSTEM LIMIT",
    "code": "CSN-1.E · prior CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A complete service needs more than a surviving route; endpoints and application behavior also matter.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A complete service needs more than a surviving route; endpoints and application behavior also matter.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Path</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">connected links</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Endpoints</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">sender + receiver work</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Application</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">processes correct data</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A path cannot repair a failed receiving application by itself.</p>",
    "note": "容错层次范围：NetworkLab只判连通，不验证服务器程序、输入内容或TCP连接状态。把上一课packet收到与应用正确处理连接起来。",
    "time": "36–40 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Investigation: define the baseline",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#resilience\" target=\"_blank\">Open Resilience</a>. Reset all links; predict and record the baseline route.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–C–T, 3 hops, under the lab’s alphabetical tie rule.</div></details>",
    "note": "40–44分钟活动1。记录网络版本和规则，之后一次只改变规定边组。先预测再按模型核对，不把不同初始边状态结果混在一张表。",
    "time": "40–44 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Test one lost link",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M521.0 51.0L539.0 69.0M521.0 69.0L539.0 51.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Disable only A–C. Predict reachability, a valid route and its hop count.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Reachable. S–A–D–T uses 3 hops and is the selected route.</div></details>",
    "note": "44–48分钟活动2。失效表列关闭集合、预期/实际可达、实际路径。若学生提出S-B-D-T也有效，但要区分自己的证据路线和模型确定选中路线。",
    "time": "44–48 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Not every failure changes the selected route",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<p>Reset between trials. Test only S–A disabled, then only C–D disabled.</p><p>For each trial, predict whether the baseline path still works.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Without S–A: selected S–B–D–T. Without C–D: selected S–A–C–T remains unchanged. Both use 3 hops.</div></details>",
    "note": "48–52分钟活动3。S-A在基准上所以改路；C-D不在基准上，关闭可不影响选中路。没有变化不是操作无效，仍应确认边已失效且解释结果。",
    "time": "48–52 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Test a disconnecting failure set",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 106.0L234.0 124.0M216.0 124.0L234.0 106.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 216.0L234.0 234.0M216.0 234.0L234.0 216.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Disable S–A and S–B together. Explain the result without merely repeating the lab label.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">No path exists: S has no working first link. Links among A, B, C, D and T cannot overcome that isolation.</div></details>",
    "note": "52–58分钟活动4，6分钟。同时关闭二边是一个集合试验，不能与依次单边关闭混淆。解释结构原因比单写disconnected更有价值。",
    "time": "52–58 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Test a longer surviving route",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 216.0L234.0 234.0M216.0 234.0L234.0 216.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M521.0 161.0L539.0 179.0M521.0 179.0L539.0 161.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M886.0 106.0L904.0 124.0M886.0 124.0L904.0 106.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Disable S–B, A–D and C–T. Predict a path and its hop count.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–C–D–T remains, using 4 hops. It is longer than the baseline 3-hop route.</div></details>",
    "note": "58–64分钟活动5。剩余边S-A,A-C,C-D,D-T,B-D；B为从D出发的支路，不能让S直接到B。逐边证明4跳。若采用每跳1单位模型，成本由3到4，但真实延迟仍未知。",
    "time": "58–64 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Propose a targeted improvement on paper",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.2/6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A paper design adds a direct S-T link to address isolation caused by losing both current S links.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A paper design adds a direct S-T link to address isolation caused by losing both current S links.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Failure to tolerate</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">both S links fail</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Proposed new link</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S–T</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Review</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">benefit +</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">remaining risk</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Would the new link help that failure set? Name one failure it would not solve.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">It would provide S–T if that new link works. It would not solve failure of S or T itself.</div></details>",
    "note": "64–68分钟活动6。Lab不支持加边，明确纸面设计不假装按钮添加过。新增直连成本与物理独立性也需评估；只证明针对二边故障有帮助。",
    "time": "64–68 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Write a bounded reliability claim",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A defensible reliability claim names the tested failures, surviving function and scope limits.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A defensible reliability claim names the tested failures, surviving function and scope limits.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Evidence</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">tested failure set</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Function</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">S-to-T reachability</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Boundary</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">untested combinations</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">and real conditions</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Use “tolerated this failure set” rather than “can never fail.”</p>",
    "note": "68–72分钟活动7。写四行结论：基准、单边替代、隔离、较长路线；再写局限。本图实测可判每单边都不隔离S-T，但如果未逐个测试不能声称已穷尽所有多故障。",
    "time": "68–72 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Evaluate an overclaim",
    "tag": "TRANSFER",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<p>A team tested one failed edge and concluded: “Our network is immune to failure.”</p><p>Give a counterexample from the graph and improve the claim.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Losing S–A and S–B disconnects S. A better claim is: the network tolerates the particular single-link failure tested.</div></details>",
    "note": "用反例纠正范围，无需全组合证明。若团队测试的是所有单边，允许更强但仍有限的“所有单边故障下S-T仍连通”。",
    "time": "72–76 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Original check: select TWO",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<ul><li>A. A surviving route can help preserve communication.</li><li>B. Redundancy guarantees no future downtime.</li><li>C. Extra links never require resources.</li><li>D. A shared failure can affect multiple alternatives.</li></ul><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A and D. B confuses fault tolerance with immunity; C ignores construction and maintenance costs.</div></details>",
    "note": "选择题连接定义、成组风险与成本。学生需说明A中的can而非must，尤其端点仍可能失败。",
    "time": "76–80 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Compare two designs by a stated requirement",
    "tag": "DESIGN REASONING",
    "code": "CSN-1.E.1–7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Design comparison begins with a specific failure requirement and evidence about alternatives.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Design comparison begins with a specific failure requirement and evidence about alternatives.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Requirement</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">survive one link failure</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Evidence</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">test each relevant link</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Decision</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">coverage + resources</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A larger diagram is not automatically a better design for every purpose.</p>",
    "note": "用功能需求评价，不比较画得漂亮或边多。若保护目标从S-T改成每对节点，必须重新检查，之前结论不能自动延伸。",
    "time": "80–84 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and evidence to keep",
    "tag": "HOMEWORK",
    "code": "Chapter 5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 teacher marks</p><ul><li>Show the working links in each route.</li><li>Keep failure sets explicit.</li><li>Distinguish model hop cost from measured delay.</li></ul>",
    "note": "保存失效表供L26综合调查调用。允许等价正确路径，但模型选中路径必须按给定tie规则。",
    "time": "84–87 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "code": "CSN-1.E",
    "html": "<p>1. What is redundancy?<br>2. Why do S–A and S–B failing together disconnect S?<br>3. Give one limit of the lab’s reliability claim.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Extra components that can mitigate other failures.<br>2. S has no working incident link.<br>3. The model omits conditions such as endpoint failure, capacity or shared physical risks.</div></details>",
    "note": "三点各1分。冗余不要定义为重复发送垃圾数据；需连接额外资源与故障缓解。",
    "time": "87–90 min"
  }
]
